    [38;2;117;121;127m◆ [1mThought[0m[38;2;117;121;127m[48;2;47;48;54m for 12.0s[39m
[38;2;67;70;78m┌[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mHow to tell what's high signal comes down to keeping gathering and judging apart:[39m                                                                                                                  [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m1. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mGather wide and cheap.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m Grok for X, web search, feeds, blogs. It collects lots of junk, and that's fine.[39m                                                                                         [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m2. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mFilter with a decision model.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m Score each item against a short written profile per domain: what counts as signal for you there, with good and bad examples. Jev already does this kind of[39m        [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mscoring, and dpi's backend already has a Jev client. It's fast and cheap, and it scores items the same way each time.[39m                                                                              [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m3. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mSynthesize with a strong model.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m Only what passes the filter goes to Opus or Sonnet for the report or strategy. That's where the Anthropic credit should go.[39m                                     [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m4. [1m[38;2;197;201;199mYour feedback is the tuning.[0m[38;2;197;201;199m[48;2;47;48;54m You mark items keep or drop. Those marks become the profile's examples and a test set, so you can measure whether the filter is improving. You already have that[39m   [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mmeasuring tool from experiment 007: jev-bench, which compares Jev against hand labels.[39m                                                                                                             [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mYour "fine-tune over time" is step 4. For now it means improving the profile and threshold against your marks, not retraining a model.[39m                                                             [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mThe foundation is the same for each domain:[39m                                                                                                                                                        [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m• [38;2;197;201;199mone profile (what's signal)[39m                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m• [38;2;197;201;199mone inbox or to-do list[39m                                                                                                                                                                          [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m• [38;2;197;201;199mone memory file[39m                                                                                                                                                                                  [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m• [38;2;197;201;199mone output folder[39m                                                                                                                                                                                [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m• [38;2;197;201;199mone long-lived dpi session, with its heartbeat added later[39m                                                                                                                                       [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mGiven 3 days of credit, I'd start with Water & Stone. It has the clearest payoff: lead research and a RevOps strategy are long, synthesis-heavy work, which is exactly what Opus is good for.[39m      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mCareer and dev-infra come next, since they're mostly scouting that goes through the filter.[39m                                                                                                        [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;197;201;199mTwo things I need from you:[39m                                                                                                                                                                        [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                      [38;2;67;70;78m
│[39m   [38;2;117;121;127m• [38;2;197;201;199mWhere should the domain folders live: Obsidian, pi-durable-lab, or a new repo?[39m                                                                                                                   [38;2;67;70;78m
